OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man to fall silent on
OL,4,ARemembrance Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of events are set to take
OL,7,Fplace across the Isle of Man this
OL,8,Fweekend in honour of the sacrifices
OL,9,Fmade by members of the armed forces
OL,10,Fpast and present.
OL,12,FA national two-minute silence will be
OL,13,Fobserved at 11:00 GMT on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe government said motorists who
OL,16,Fwanted to take part could stop their
OL,17,Fvehicles safely and turn off their
OL,18,Fengines.
OL,20,FCeremonies and services have been
OL,21,Forganised by local authorities and the
OL,22,FRoyal British Legion.
